OL,3,ATenko and Coronation Street actress
OL,4,AStephanie Cole dies aged 84
OL,5,
OL,6,F"She brought joy to millions through
OL,7,Fher many much-loved roles in sitcom and
OL,8,Fdrama. She will also be remembered for
OL,9,Fher tireless work supporting mental
OL,10,Fhealth charities."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/17
